		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Rare Focus</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 50,000 g</p><p><em>Engraved symbol of divine favor, heat radiating from within.</em></p><hr><p>Tiered Radiant spells apply <strong>Dawnmark</strong> to your target or a creature adjacent to your target.</p><p><strong>Dawnmark</strong> (stackable): on attack, consume all stacks to deal additional Radiant damage based on the stacks consumed (1d4 &gt; 1d6 &gt; &hellip; &gt; 1d20). The module tracks stacks on targets automatically while this focus is equipped &mdash; use the <em>Consume Dawnmark</em> action from any Blazing Dawn item.</p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; DanDraco, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
